,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #7725\n\n## What\n\n`pm-stack/aggregator/src/activity.ts` capped activity summaries with raw `slice(0, 500)` at four sites — the watchdog writer (:120), both kaneo writers (:196/:207), and the record-time persist cap in `IngestionStore` (:485) — splitting surrogate pairs and bypassing the `capUnits` guard #7694/#7711 merged today for `actions.ts`. A title whose emoji straddled the cap produced a persisted summary ending in a lone high surrogate, which any UTF-8 round-trip renders as U+FFFD.\n\nThis adds a local `capUnits` helper mirroring the actions.ts semantics (an astral character straddling the cap is dropped whole) and routes all four caps through it.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Probe (real module, laptop @ f9dfb4cfa5): watchdog + kaneo straddle cases ended in lone `\\ud83d` pre-fix; control (pair fully inside the cap) intact.\n- New regression tests in `test/activity-3321.test.ts` (watchdog straddle, watchdog exact-fit control, kaneo straddle, record-time cap via the link suffix): the 3 straddle tests fail on pre-fix code, all pass post-fix.\n- `bun test test/activity-3321.test.ts`: 20/20 pass. Full aggregator suite run on the branch (see PR checks / issue note for the result).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796740203&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7730&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7730&signature=fd212106e148b97483e62aac8d437370eae46121bb819ab82f3519e72b987749\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7730?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[{"id":12834267441,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PthMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","description":"Something isn't working (prefixed form of the classic bug label)","color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834286196,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PuqdA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/source/creator","name":"source/creator","description":"Filed by the new-issue-creator job","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12835692920,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_REheA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/app/aggregator","name":"app/aggregator","description":"Package/app: aggregator (pm-stack in this repo)","color":"1d76db","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-08T14:29:59Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T14:30:44Z","closed_at":"2026-11-08T14:30:41Z","merged_at":"2026-11-08T14:30:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"4e4c7ad969d766d5c39f79e6071f9c416d013480","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/follower